<<<
In all these the word should be observation; one quotation is added in which observation is wrongly used for observance: The British Government has failed to secure the observation of law & has lost the confidence of all classes.
===
In all these the word should be *observation*; one quotation is added in which *observation* is wrongly used for *observance*: *The British Government has failed to secure* the observation of law *& has lost the confidence of all classes.*
